1
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:06,470
Hello. I'm Dr.
Sheldon Cooper.

2
00:00:06,474 --> 00:00:11,214
(Sheldon:)And welcome to Sheldon Cooper
Presents: Fun with Flags,

3
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:13,482
(Sheldon:)the Final Episode
Flagtacular.

4
00:00:13,481 --> 00:00:15,281
(gasps)

5
00:00:15,282 --> 00:00:18,682
(Sheldon:)I knew it was coming.
Still scary.

6
00:00:18,686 --> 00:00:21,456
(Sheldon:)Now, I'm sure you're thinking,
"The final episode?

7
00:00:21,455 --> 00:00:24,795
(Sheldon:)Who will stand between
us and flag ignorance?"

8
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:26,962
(Amy:)I know I was thinking that.

9
00:00:26,961 --> 00:00:30,801
(Amy:)Is this a show on flags
or mind reading?

10
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:34,538
(Sheldon:)But the truth is I can no longer
balance a full-time career,

11
00:00:34,535 --> 00:00:37,205
(Sheldon:)a popular Internet show,
and a girlfriend.

12
00:00:37,204 --> 00:00:42,044
(Amy:)And he really does have one,
you jerks on the comment board.

13
00:00:42,043 --> 00:00:45,713
(Sheldon:)So as they say, all good
things must come to an end.

14
00:00:45,713 --> 00:00:48,843
(Amy:)After only 232 episodes.

15
00:00:48,849 --> 00:00:51,249
(Sheldon:)233 if we
include the one

16
00:00:51,252 --> 00:00:54,652
(Sheldon:)somebody forgot
to press record on.

17
00:00:54,655 --> 00:00:56,655
(quietly): You said
you weren't gonna bring that up.

18
00:00:56,657 --> 00:00:57,787
(quietly): And you
said you pressed record.

19
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,860
(Sheldon:)Anyway, please
sit back, relax,

20
00:01:02,863 --> 00:01:05,933
(Sheldon:)and join us as we
take our final lap...

21
00:01:07,034 --> 00:01:09,934
(Sheldon:)...as indicated by the
waving of this racing flag.

22
00:01:09,937 --> 00:01:12,737
(Sheldon:)And, of course, white flags
can also represent surrender,

23
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:15,840
(Sheldon:)the Stewards of Gondor, and
the Japanese Minamoto clan,

24
00:01:15,843 --> 00:01:18,343
(Sheldon:)but I'm sure you remember
that from episode 62,

25
00:01:18,345 --> 00:01:22,585
"White Flags: Who's
Wavin' 'Em and Why?"

26
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:24,053
(Amy:)That was a good one.

27
00:01:24,051 --> 00:01:27,021
(Sheldon:)It was so good.

